        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='32878' id='15' type-v2='text' w='48379' x='48192' y='66377'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='12'>- Test Group  is 25 seconds faster than Control, primarily because of faster movement into Step 1 and from Step 3 to confirmation.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='12'>- The Step 1 to Step 2 transition is slightly slower in Test, while Step 2 to Step 3 takes the same median time in both groups. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='12'>-Transition frequency declines throughout both journeys, indicating that some users do not generate every subsequent forward transition.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='6824' id='7' type-v2='title' w='77431' x='17269' y='7196' />
